    "description": "Peterson of Dublin Killarney 69\nBent Billiard Briar Tobacco Smoking Pipe\nRed Finish Briar, With Original Box & Pouch\nPeterson of Dublin has been crafting traditional briar pipes in Ireland since 1865, renowned worldwide for their distinguished shaping, balance, and craftsmanship. The Killarney series features a rich, polished red stain over select briar grain accented by bright nickel trim. Shape 69 presents a classic bent billiard silhouette prized for comfortable clenching and excellent smoking dynamics.\nPeterson Killarney shape 69 bent billiard bowl crafted from quality briar wood\nGlossy translucent red finish highlighting the natural briar grain\nBlack stem with stamped Peterson \"P\" emblem and double accent ring band\nStamped \"Peterson's Killarney\" on the shank\nIncludes original Peterson green presentation box and green cloth drawstring pipe pouch\nTotal stem length measures 4 inches\nCondition:\nPipe shows light previous use with minor carbon cake inside the bowl and faint rim darkening. Briar finish is clean and glossy with no cracks or major dents. Stem exhibits minor superficial teeth chatter. Original box and drawstring bag are present and intact.",
